reparse <id> - refresh local attachment metadata
  aliases / examples: /reparse <id>
workspace - show target and state status
  aliases / examples: /workspace, workspace status
workspace reindex - refresh the v3 content-addressed workspace index
  aliases / examples: /workspace reindex, workspace index
findings export <path> [format] [--completeness open|complete] [--allow-empty] - export findings; choose
all/open/complete and pass --allow-empty for metadata-only exports
